---
title: 火车票锁座与支付确认
config:
  themeVariables:
    actorBorder: '#7dd3fc'
    signalColor: '#6ee7b7'
    noteBorderColor: '#fbbf24'
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Rider as 旅客
    participant Tickets as 票务
    participant Pay as 支付

    Rider->>+Tickets: 确认购票
    Tickets->>Tickets: 尝试锁座
    break 座位已占
        Tickets-->>Rider: 提示重选
    end
    Tickets->>+Pay: 按单号扣款
    Pay-->>-Tickets: 支付状态
    Note over Tickets,Pay: 结果未明时保持锁座
    loop 支付待定
        Tickets->>+Pay: 按单号查单
        Pay-->>-Tickets: 支付状态
    end
    alt 扣款成功
        Tickets->>Tickets: 确认占座
        Tickets-->>Rider: 返回车票
    else 扣款失败
        Tickets->>Tickets: 释放座位
        Tickets-->>Rider: 支付失败
    end
    deactivate Tickets
